== About me ==
Hi, I'm Basedgirl, a Virginia girl who edits from the [[Virginia|Old Dominion]].

I'm here to be useful. Most of my time goes to patrolling new pages, helping new editors through [[Wikipedia:Articles for creation|Articles for creation]], and reverting [[vandalism]]. I pay extra attention to [[Wikipedia:Biographies of living persons|biographies of living persons]], because they need to be sourced carefully.

If you disagree with an edit of mine, please leave a message on my [[User talk:Basedgirl|talk page]]. I'm happy to talk it through.

